[NC]Broken hearts and dirty [G]windows, [A]make life difficult to [D]see.
That's why last night and this [G]mornin', [A7]always look the same to [D]me.
And I hate reading old love [G]letters, [A]for they always bring me [D]tears.
I can't forgive the way they [G]rob me, [A7]of my sweetheart's souven[D]irs.[D]     [d][-][c#][-][b][-][a]

